flowchart TD
    A[Licensed bird image dataset] --> B[Verify labels, duplicates, and class counts]
    B --> C[Split by source or individual where possible]
    C --> D[Resize and normalize]
    D --> E[Training-only augmentation]
    E --> F[Convolution + activation]
    F --> G[Pooling]
    G --> H[Repeated feature-extraction blocks]
    H --> I[Global pooling or flatten]
    I --> J[Dense layer and softmax]
    J --> K[Train with validation and early stopping]
    K --> L[Untouched test evaluation]
    L --> M[Per-species metrics, confusion matrix, sample predictions]
